  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Cadastre Proj Fisc - Fiscal Cadastre Proj Fisc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">First Cadastre Proj Fisc</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity buildning and institutional development to the Moldovan First Cadastre Project funded by a World Bank credit. This project is an extension of ongoing Sida support since 1997. Technical assistance will cover development of the fiscal cadastre, a training centre, a business plan for the regional cadastre offices and a study on long-term strategy for the cadastre authority.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d med kapacitetsutveckling till Moldovan First Cadastre Project (lantm&#xe4;teri)som fianiseras av en kredit fr&#xe5;n V&#xe4;rldsbanken. Insatsen &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; fortl&#xf6;pande st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida sedan 1997. Insatsen omfattar s k fiscal cadastre, ett utbildningscentrum, en aff&#xe4;rsplan f&#xf6;r de regionala lantm&#xe4;terikontoren och en studie av en l&#xe5;ngsiktig strategi f&#xf6;r lantm&#xe4;terimyndigheten.</narrative>
  </description>
